"""
rms_workbook.py - writes the results workbook with the SAME sheets / cell positions the VBA produces.

    Results             RP_ResetForNewRun + RP_PullEpForAnalysis      (GU + GR, AEP/OEP)
    Meta                16-column schema (+ grouped analysis row from MI_AppendGroupedAnalysisToMeta)
    RDS Events          RP_PullRdsForAnalysis + RP_FormatRdsEvents
    RDS Debug           RP_LogDebug
    Top Locations       RP_PullTopLocationsForAnalysis + RP_FormatTopLocations
    Top Locations Debug
    Marginal Impact     MI_WriteLabelScaffold / MI_WriteResultBlock / MI_WriteMarginalBlock
    Locations / Map     modLocationsHazard
    Report Summary      modReportSummary (every block, number format, colour and CF rule)

NOT reproduced (they are workbook templates / PivotTables, not VBA output): the per-layer 'EP Gross'
copy tabs and the 'Exposure Summary' PivotTable. Report Summary reads the same numbers straight from
the API data instead of from those tabs.
"""
